            "content": "<h4><strong>Experience the Power of Our Quell - 4 Person - Office Pod</strong></h4><p>Experience the power of our Quell 4-person office pod today. Elevate your meetings, boost productivity, and create a focused work environment like never before. Whether you're looking for spacious collaboration or intimate discussions, our versatile meeting pod offers the perfect solution.</p><p> </p><p>Don't wait; take the next step towards a more productive workspace. Choose the Quell 4-person office pod that suits your needs, and discover the difference it can make.</p>",
